### FAA A&P Exam Backend — pruebas rápidas (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Registrar alumno
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alumno Demo", "email": "alumno@demo.com", "password": "clave12345" }

### Login (copia el token de la respuesta a @token)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alumno@demo.com", "password": "clave12345" }

### Solicitar código de restablecimiento
POST {{base}}/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alumno@demo.com" }

### Verificar el código (copia resetToken de la respuesta)
POST {{base}}/auth/password-reset/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alumno@demo.com", "code": "123456" }

### Restablecer contraseña (pega el resetToken tras verificar el código)
POST {{base}}/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resetToken": "PEGA_EL_RESET_TOKEN_AQUI", "password": "nueva-clave-123" }

### Mi perfil
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Materias por rating
GET {{base}}/questions/subjects?rating=AMP
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preguntas escritas por materia (aleatorias)
GET {{base}}/questions/written?rating=AMP&subject=Turbine Engines&limit=20&random=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preguntas con figura
GET {{base}}/questions/figures?rating=AMG
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Banco oral
GET {{base}}/questions/oral?rating=AMP&subject=Propellers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generar examen escrito oficial (AMP = 100 preguntas)
GET {{base}}/exam/written/AMP
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Guardar progreso de una sesión de estudio
POST {{base}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": "AMP", "subject": "Turbine Engines", "correct": 17, "attempted": 20 }

### Ver mi progreso
GET {{base}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
